  "wrap": "Reviewed metformin 500 mg refill pricing: the August 18 30-day fill at Oak Street Pharmacy was $8 under preferred retail, while the September 16 30-day fill at Lakeview Pharmacy was $27 under standard retail; the prescription did not change. Confirmed and submitted enrollment in the CenterWell pharmacy service for future metformin fills only; atorvastatin remains at retail, and today’s ready refill remains at Lakeview Pharmacy. The 90-day option was explained as a future eligible-supply option that does not place an order, start automatic refills, or change today’s pickup. A coverage case for Jardiance 10 mg tablets is pending review.\n\nConnection result: DEMO-TRANSFER001 — receiving_specialist_connected. DEMO-CVR001 remains pending_review. Connection is not a coverage determination.\n\nDEMO-ENR001 · metformin · For metformin 500 mg, the August 18 30-day fill at Oak Street Pharmacy was $8 un · DEMO-CVR001",
